Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.06,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.06,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}斯瓦泰克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-3{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 莱巴金娜 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,sorry that I had to win the first title with you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉 拿下这第一冠时 你不在场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,when you weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你没能在现场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, and yeah, as I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:08.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我刚才说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to dedicate this title to everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想把这个冠军献给
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,who is dealing uh with unfair judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一个正在承受不公评判
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,和恶意的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:17.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, just keep pushing, keep growing,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续努力 继续成长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.64,EN,,0,0,0,,keep focusing on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,because you know what's the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,for you and always
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,才是对你最好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and always remember what's ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,永远记得前面
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and um what's might be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有什么是可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:38.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Um so yeah, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:38.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好了 我们走到了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
